#: f04536e90b48424c9dd865d55735ca43
msgid "**<ConID>**：ConID：创建 SOCKET 连接后获取到的连接 ID"
msgstr ""
"**<ConID>**: Connection ID obtained after creating a SOCKET connection"

#: ../../source/docs/command-set/TCP-IP_AT_Commands.rst:247
#: 01bfff9167e94baa8b73a334a6c921d9
msgid ""
"注意 TCPServer 的连接无法收发数据，只能给客户端连接到 TCPServer 后创建的 seed 才能收发送数据；UDP Client "
"需要先发送一次数据之后 server 端获取到本地的端口才可以向该 upd client 发送数据。"
msgstr ""
"Note: TCPServer connections cannot send/receive data; only seeds created "
"after a client connects to TCPServer can. UDP Client must send data once so "
"the server learns the local port before sending to that UDP client."

#: ../../source/docs/command-set/TCP-IP_AT_Commands.rst:252
#: abc660cbb83e41aea83aac372b7566d6
msgid "从指定连接读取数据。注意：读取的时候是按包读取的，一次读取一包数据"
msgstr ""
"Read data from the specified connection. Note: reads are packet-based; one "
"packet per read."

#: ../../source/docs/command-set/TCP-IP_AT_Commands.rst:269
